-- Theorem (Transparent receptive view contracts the observation fiber):
-- When a sensory view get : S → V is an equivalence (lossless structure-preserving encoding),
-- the human observer's fiber over every percept v : V is contractible: zero hidden degrees of freedom.
transparent-view-contracts-fiber : {S V : Type} → (get : S → V) → isEquiv get →
  (v : V) → isContr (fiber get v)
transparent-view-contracts-fiber get eq v = eq v
